# Natural-language wording of each question in portfolio.chain (authored by the AI assistant).
q1 | What percentage of the logistics stake are we planning to sell right now?
q2 | Who is the preferred buyer at the moment?
q3 | By when must the divestment be executed, as things stand?
q4 | What is the current status of the divestment execution?
q5 | What percentage of the stake were we planning to sell on 8 May 2026?
q6 | On 15 May 2026, what stake percentage was in force?
q7 | What was the divestment execution deadline on 2026-05-07?
q8 | What was the divestment execution deadline on May 14, 2026?
q9 | What execution deadline applied on 25 May 2026?
q10 | Based on what had been recorded by 5 June 2026, what was the execution deadline on 25 May 2026?
q11 | Which buyer was preferred on 20 May 2026?
q12 | How many times has the execution deadline been moved since it was first set? Count only changes that stuck; ignore anything announced and then withdrawn or corrected before it took effect.
